# onnxruntime-node (pulled in by kokoro-js for the voice render) downloads a
# GPU build on any Linux x64 install, which Cloudflare's builder is. That
# download is a 404, so the site's deploy failed from 2026-11-21 on. The app
# and the render never use a GPU: skip it (know-how, "The site stopped
# updating after a push").
onnxruntime-node-install-cuda=skip
